{"id":"wb-6-800","name":"西来寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"西来寺 (张掖)","text":"西来寺，位于中国甘肃省张掖市甘州区西来寺巷，为汉传佛教禅宗寺院，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n西来寺始建于唐朝，明朝重建，原名为“慈云精舍”。清朝康熙五十九年（1702年）重修，更名为“西来寺”。现为甘州区佛教协会驻地。现有山门、观音殿、藏经楼、金刚殿等建筑，金刚殿是张掖市唯一一处明代建筑。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E6%9D%A5%E5%AF%BA_(%E5%BC%A0%E6%8E%96)","revisionId":85692334,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85692334","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/904e2d03c6643cbaa1a2e5ae.jpg","title":"Zhangye_Xilai_Si_2014.01.02_10-37-38.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Zhangye_Xilai_Si_2014.01.02_10-37-38.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c1/Zhangye_Xilai_Si_2014.01.02_10-37-38.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"张掖西来寺——\n\n文保碑","width":320,"height":213}}